# Milestone 13: lists (reference/components/list.md). Pages of 595 × 300 with margins of 40: page
# area of 515 × 220 from (40, 40), which ends at y = 260. Lines of 12 (Size 10).
#
# The indent of all the lists is their left Padding of 20, declared in Styles. Each
# marker hangs to the left of its item, with its trailing space: at 5 pt per character,
# "9. " measures 15 and "10. " measures 20, right-aligned against the item.
# Item n11 starts with a nested list: its marker and that of sa share the line.
# The list long (Width 200: items of 180, 36 characters per line and 4 words of 7) is split:
# r2 has 5 lines and 3 fit; its marker is only in the first fragment.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: es
	Title: Prueba
	Page:
		Width: 595
		Height: 300
		Margin: 40
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
		For element: List
			Box:
				Padding: 0 0 0 20
	Section:
		List:
			Id: num
			Marker: decimal
			Start: 9
			List item:
				Id: n9
				Text: Nueve
			List item:
				Id: n10
				Text: Diez
			List item:
				Id: n11
				List:
					Id: sub
					Marker: lower-alpha
					List item:
						Id: sa
						Text: Primera
					List item:
						Id: sb
						Number: 4
						Text: Cuarta
		Block:
			Id: fill
			Box:
				Height: 100
				Background: #F1EFE8
		List:
			Id: long
			Marker: upper-roman
			Box:
				Width: 200
			List item:
				Id: r1
				Text:
					Content >>
						Informe balance factura cliente
						archivo partida importe resumen
						detalle ingreso balance factura
			List item:
				Id: r2
				Text:
					Content >>
						Resumen detalle ingreso balance
						factura cliente archivo informe
						partida importe resumen detalle
						ingreso balance factura cliente
						archivo informe partida importe
		Paragraph: Fin.
			Id: after
